          {
            "text": "Sairee Hut Restaurant Restaurant & BBQ offers up a variety of food which cater to all tastes and\nbudgets\nfrom breakfast, lunch and dinner. Enjoy authentic Thai, Western, Seafood, BBQ and Cocktails with\nsunset view on Sairee beach",
